@startuml
left to right direction
skinparam shadowing false
title SysML use case view - SmartTrafficLightSystem
actor TrafficDataSource as Source
actor RoadUsers as Users
rectangle "BLK-01 SmartTrafficLightSystem" {
 usecase "UC-01\nObserveTraffic" as UC01
 usecase "UC-02\nServeApproach" as UC02
 usecase "UC-03\nMaintainSafeSignals" as UC03
 usecase "UC-04\nHandleDataFailure" as UC04
}
Source -- UC01
Users -- UC02
UC02 ..> UC03 : <<include>>
UC04 ..> UC02 : <<extend>>\n[dataFault]
note bottom of UC01
Input counts are provided externally.
VehicleDetection is inside the system.
end note
note bottom of UC04
Fallback preserves current grant,
clearance, eligible set and wait timers.
end note
@enduml
